Althea!

1436
01:49:59,198 --> 01:50:01,992
Althea!

1437
01:50:07,373 --> 01:50:09,166
Querida!

1438
01:50:09,375 --> 01:50:11,168
Querida!

1439
01:50:12,628 --> 01:50:14,630
Querida!

1440
01:50:19,468 --> 01:50:20,803
Querida!

1441
01:50:21,011 --> 01:50:22,680
Querida!

1442
01:50:22,846 --> 01:50:25,015
Não! Não!

1443
01:50:25,808 --> 01:50:29,311
